From 0947dbbd661f203e706b99ed68c03c98e392cb91 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lynxtron Scripts <scripts@lynxtron>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 19:23:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add HarmonyOS support to base

Recognise the OHOS target throughout //base so chromium's base can build
and run inside a HarmonyOS HAP:

  - build gn files: compile the harmony sources and drop the host-only
    pieces that the OHOS NDK sysroot cannot provide.
  - partition_alloc: add the aarch64/OHOS configuration and route the
    allocator shim's C++ symbol overrides through musl rather than glibc.
  - logging / set_process_title / cancelable_event / json_reader: use the
    POSIX paths that musl actually implements.
